=========================================================
                TELEGRAM SHOP BOT DOCUMENTATION
=========================================================

OVERVIEW
--------
This Telegram bot allows users to browse products, place orders, check their balance, view their profile, and deposit Litecoin (LTC). 
Admins can manage products, view/export orders, and manage user balances. 
All data is stored in JSON files.

---------------------------------------------------------
USER FEATURES
---------------------------------------------------------
- View Products: 
    Browse all available products, see price, stock, and order or view details.

- Order Products: 
    Place an order by selecting a product and quantity. The bot checks stock and user balance.

- My Orders: 
    View your order history, including product name, quantity, and order status.

- My Balance: 
    Check your current coin balance.

- Profile: 
    View your profile info, join date, order count, and balance.

- Deposit LTC: 
    Get a Litecoin deposit address (placeholder). Balance is updated manually.

- Help: 
    Get usage instructions.

- Categories: 
    /categories – List product categories and browse by category.

- Search: 
    /search <keyword> – Search for products by name or description.

---------------------------------------------------------
ADMIN FEATURES
---------------------------------------------------------
- Add Product:
    /addproduct Name | Price | FileID_or_ImageURL | Stock | [Description] | [Category]
    Example: /addproduct Magic Potion | 50 | <file_id> | 10 | Restores health | Potions

- Remove Product:
    /removeproduct <index>
    Example: /removeproduct 0

- Edit Product:
    /editproduct <index> | <field> | <new_value>
    Fields: name, price, image, stock, description

- Product List:
    /productlist – List all products with their indexes.

- Export Orders:
    /exportorders – Export all orders as a CSV file.

- All Orders:
    /allorders – View all orders for all users.

- Set Order Status:
    /setorderstatus <user_id> <order_index> <status>
    Example: /setorderstatus 123456789 0 shipped
    Notifies the user of the status change.

- Balance Management:
    /balance – Check your own balance.
    /addcoins <user_id> <amount> – Add coins to a user.
    /setcoins <user_id> <amount> – Set a user’s balance.
    /topusers – Show top users by coin balance.

---------------------------------------------------------
DATA STORAGE
---------------------------------------------------------
- products.json:
    List of products with fields: name, price, image, stock, description, category.

- orders.json:
    User orders, keyed by user ID. Each order includes name, quantity, and order_status.

- balances.json:
    User coin balances, keyed by user ID.

- first_join.json:
    User join dates.

- deposit_addresses.json:
    User Litecoin deposit addresses (placeholder).

---------------------------------------------------------
MAIN COMMANDS
---------------------------------------------------------
| Command                        | Description                          | Who        |
|---------------------------------|--------------------------------------|------------|
| /start                          | Show main menu and balance           | User       |
| /categories                     | List product categories              | User       |
| /search <keyword>               | Search products                      | User       |
| /addproduct ...                 | Add a new product                    | Admin      |
| /removeproduct <index>          | Remove a product                     | Admin      |
| /editproduct ...                | Edit a product                       | Admin      |
| /productlist                    | List all products                    | Admin      |
| /exportorders                   | Export all orders as CSV             | Admin      |
| /allorders                      | View all orders                      | Admin      |
| /setorderstatus ...             | Update order status and notify user  | Admin      |
| /balance                        | Show your balance                    | User/Admin |
| /addcoins <user_id> <amount>    | Add coins to a user                  | Admin      |
| /setcoins <user_id> <amount>    | Set a user’s balance                 | Admin      |
| /topusers                       | Show top users by balance            | Admin      |
| /deposit_ltc                    | Show your Litecoin deposit address   | User       |

---------------------------------------------------------
ORDER FLOW
---------------------------------------------------------
1. User selects a product and quantity.
2. Bot checks stock and balance.
3. On confirmation, order is saved with status "pending", stock and balance are updated.
4. Admins are notified of new orders.
5. Admins can update order status, which notifies the user.

---------------------------------------------------------
PRODUCT BROWSING
---------------------------------------------------------
- Users can browse all products, filter by category, or search by keyword.
- Each product shows name, price, stock, and category.

---------------------------------------------------------
DEPOSIT SYSTEM
---------------------------------------------------------
- Users get a unique (placeholder) Litecoin address.
- Deposits are not actually processed; this is a stub for future integration.

---------------------------------------------------------
TECHNICAL NOTES
---------------------------------------------------------
- All data is persistent and stored in JSON files.
- Only users in ADMIN_IDS can use admin commands.
- Error handling is provided for invalid input and unavailable actions.
- The bot uses async handlers and the latest python-telegram-bot API.

=========================================================